# Firebase client config, generated by `expo prebuild` / `expo run:*`.
# Kept out of git because this repository is public: these files carry an
# api_key and oauth_client entries, and anything committed here is permanent
# and searchable. Download your own from the Firebase console
# (Project settings -> Your apps) before building.
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
